<title>ITALY: Italian fighter crashes into sea off Sicily.</title>
<headline>Italian fighter crashes into sea off Sicily.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Italian airforce F-104 fighter plane crashed into the sea on Tuesday off the western coast of Sicily, the defence ministry said.</p>
<p>It was not immediately clear if the pilot survived, a ministry official said, adding that the cause of the crash was not yet known.</p>
